  "methods_and_limits": [
    "The geologic map intersection uses the public county tax lot and the DOGAMI map-unit features, with area measured in EPSG:5070. Polygon overlap measures mapped coverage; the source map scale remains 1:250,000.",
    "Nearby well observations are transcribed from the city-filed scans and retain the depth type, unit and date. Well coordinates and straight-line distances were not independently checked. The distance bound is what the groundwater addendum reports.",
    "The null encounter depth in MARI 13572 records a missing field, even though the later addendum supplies an interpretation. The nearby well measurements are historical and apply to their wells.",
    "Dry observations apply only to the depths reached by the five hand augers on the observation date. No seasonal high groundwater, foundation suitability, site-wide subsurface conditions, water supply or water right was measured by this analysis."
  ]
